  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Missher DSH Context Manager",
      "text": "**高质量压缩，让长会话继续任务。**\n\n中文 · [English](./README.en.md) · [下载 / Release](https://github.com/Missher12/Missher-DSH-Context-Manager/releases) · [反馈](https://github.com/Missher12/Missher-DSH-Context-Manager/issues)\n\n<sub>本机实拍，使用虚构验收材料。容量、趋势、压缩结果与摘要一页可见；压缩比例随内容而变。</sub>\n\n| 请求前检查 | 任务后空闲整理 | 随时回看 |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| 默认 **80%** | 默认 **15 分钟** | **摘要 + 来源原文** |\n\n空闲从任务正常结束后计时；实际请求检查线会结合模型预留调整。"
    },
    {
      "section": "压缩后保留什么",
      "text": "```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    A[\"较早历史\"] --> B[\"任务摘要<br/>目标 · 约束 · 已完成 · 待办<br/>证据 · 下一步 · 未核实\"]\n    B --> C[\"摘要 + 近期原文<br/>继续任务\"]\n    A -.-> D[\"原文保留<br/>按需追溯\"]\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>展开看：摘要与原文界面</strong></summary>\n\n</details>\n\n查看不调用模型；生成摘要会产生模型用量。摘要校验失败时保留原文。"
    },
    {
      "section": "三步开始",
      "text": "1. 从 [Releases](https://github.com/Missher12/Missher-DSH-Context-Manager/releases) 下载 `.tgz`。\n2. 在 **DSH 插件管理** 中安装并启用，等任务结束后按提示重启。\n3. 在 **设置 → 上下文管理** 调整策略，在会话的 **上下文** 页查看结果。\n\n<details>\n<summary>从源码构建</summary>\n\n使用标准 Node.js 24 和 `package.json` 指定的 pnpm。\n\n```sh\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile\npnpm run typecheck\npnpm run build\npnpm test\n\n</details>\n\n[MIT](./LICENSE) · [第三方声明](./THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md)\n\n[](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Missher DSH Context Manager",
      "text": "**Quality compaction that keeps long conversations moving.**\n\n[中文](./README.md) · English · [Download / Releases](https://github.com/Missher12/Missher-DSH-Context-Manager/releases) · [Feedback](https://github.com/Missher12/Missher-DSH-Context-Manager/issues)\n\n<sub>Local app screenshot with fictional acceptance material, shown in Chinese. Capacity, trends, compaction results and summary in one view. Reduction varies with content.</sub>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Missher DSH Context Manager",
      "text": "| Pre-request check | Idle after completion | Inspect anytime |\n| :---: | :---: | :---: |\n| **80%** by default | **15 minutes** by default | **Summary + original sources** |\n\nIdle timing starts after normal task completion. The effective request threshold also accounts for model reservations."
    },
    {
      "section": "What survives compaction",
      "text": "```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    A[\"Earlier history\"] --> B[\"Task summary<br/>Goal · Constraints · Completed · Pending<br/>Evidence · Next steps · Uncertainties\"]\n    B --> C[\"Summary + recent messages<br/>Continue the task\"]\n    A -.-> D[\"Originals retained<br/>Trace back when needed\"]\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>See the summary and original-source view</strong></summary>\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "What survives compaction",
      "text": "Viewing makes no model calls. Generating a summary incurs model usage; failed validation leaves the original history intact."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start in three steps",
      "text": "1. Download a `.tgz` from [Releases](https://github.com/Missher12/Missher-DSH-Context-Manager/releases).\n2. Install and enable it in **DSH's plugin manager**. Let running tasks finish before restarting as prompted.\n3. Adjust the policy in **Settings → Context Manager** and inspect results in the session's **Context** view.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Build from source</summary>\n\nUse standard Node.js 24 and the pnpm version specified in `package.json`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start in three steps",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile\npnpm run typecheck\npnpm run build\npnpm test\n\n</details>\n\n[MIT](./LICENSE) · [Third-party notices](./THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md)\n\n[](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)"
    }
  ],
